  20:     - The rectangles are the foreground objects to preserve above the new bars.
  21: 
  22:     Rule:
  23:     - Detect the blue rectangle outline objects against the teal background.
  24:     - Draw a pink full row and full column through each rectangle center.
  25:     - Redraw the original rectangles over the bars.
  26: 
  27:     Key insight:
  28:     - The bars are canvas-spanning centerlines, and the original rectangle outlines occlude
  29:       the bars where they overlap.
